VALUES (57943, 'tt0140340', NULL, 'The Love Letter', 'The Love Letter', 'movie', 1998, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7DKV2pIP6u5WvXIdUl2VA5hz3l.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/moCVgDhJdE57JBlOep4IWVO0KLK.jpg', '20th century computer games designer Scott, Civil War buff, buys an antique desk from that era and, while polishing it, he discovers a secret compartment in which sits an unmailed letter--a letter written by a young poet named Lizzie over a century earlier. Touched by her yearning for passion, he writes her back, egged on by his mystically inclined mother. Magically, his letter reaches Lizzie and they begin a correspondence that threatens Scott''s impending marriage but promises to bring fulfilment to Lizzie. Spanning the Civil War to the present, the perils of Lizzie''s war-torn situation threaten her safe passage into the future. Will their love endure the test of time?', NULL, NULL, 1.1347, 6.5, 0, 10.02, '2026-11-21 21:03:36', '2026-11-21 21:03:36')
