VALUES (895, 'tt0060107', NULL, 'Andrei Rublev', 'Андрей Рублёв', 'movie', 1966, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUihkn16SwPPIjuOyo6orHWUep6.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqha8JCXm0aJ5SJ03Jd0JmGgWRs.jpg', 'An expansive Russian drama, this film focuses on the life of revered religious icon painter Andrei Rublev. Drifting from place to place in a tumultuous era, the peace-seeking monk eventually gains a reputation for his art. But after Rublev witnesses a brutal battle and unintentionally becomes involved, he takes a vow of silence and spends time away from his work. As he begins to ease his troubled soul, he takes steps towards becoming a painter once again.', NULL, NULL, 4.3395, 7.946, 0, 20.21, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-21 21:03:36')
