VALUES (36645, 'tt0060708', NULL, 'Modesty Blaise', 'Modesty Blaise', 'movie', 1966, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpQRLEcQeWe2T8TbSJ0zJ0Avqij.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oZANPqYAF1R5fbJcDWlAyDYywpN.jpg', 'Modesty Blaise, a secret agent whose hair color, hair style, and mod clothing change at a snap of her fingers is being used by the British government as a decoy in an effort to thwart a diamond heist. She is being set up by the feds but is wise to the plot and calls in sidekick Willie Garvin and a few other friends to outsmart them. Meanwhile, at his island hideaway, Gabriel, the diamond thief has his own plans for Blaise and Garvin.', NULL, NULL, 1.2669, 5.243, 0, 2.02, '2026-07-29 20:51:09', '2026-11-21 21:03:36')
