VALUES (11873, 'tt0090863', NULL, 'The Color of Money', 'The Color of Money', 'movie', 1986, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVdnHmdQu3JtLAAksjTmTEF76gD.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hhCp6ZLDjS5wUHkGg7k3VGvH3Xm.jpg', 'Former pool hustler "Fast Eddie" Felson decides he wants to return to the game by taking a pupil. He meets talented but green Vincent Lauria and proposes a partnership. As they tour pool halls, Eddie teaches Vincent the tricks of scamming, but he eventually grows frustrated with Vincent''s showboat antics, leading to an argument and a falling-out. Eddie takes up playing again and soon crosses paths with Vincent as an opponent.', NULL, NULL, 3.8983, 6.859, 0, 1.0298571428571428e+01, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-11-21 21:03:36')
